  "Items.WhiskerFruit.CatFaceEyes": "[pg]For a moment your sight shifts as the ambient light suddenly turns extremely bright, almost blinding you. You walk around disoriented until the luminosity fades back to normal. You run to a puddle of water to check your reflection and quickly notice your pupils have become cat-like."
