  "Items.WhiskerFruit.Arms": "[pg]Weakness overcomes your arms, and no matter what you do, you can't muster the strength to raise or move them. Did the fruit have some drug-like effects? Sitting on the ground, you wait for the limpness to end. As you do so, you realize that the bones at your hands are changing, as well as the muscles on your arms. They're soon covered, from the shoulders to the tip of your digits, on a layer of soft, fluffy {0} fur. Your hands gain pink, padded paws where your palms were once, and your nails become long, thin, curved claws, sharp enough to tear flesh and nimble enough to make climbing and exploring easier. <b>Your arms have become like those of a cat!</b>"
